{
  "id": "30513_tsuijuku",
  "headword": "追熟",
  "reading": "ついじゅく",
  "romaji": "tsuijuku",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "post-harvest ripening; after-ripening",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "post-harvest ripening; after-ripening",
      "explanation": "The practice of letting fruit finish ripening after it has been picked, by leaving it at room temperature for a few days. Used of kiwis, avocados, melons, bananas and similar fruit that are shipped unripe."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "30513_tsuijuku_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦アボカド→アボカド：10704_abokado⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追熟|ついじゅく}⟦させる→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "I let the avocado ripen.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30513_tsuijuku_ex2",
      "japanese": "キウイ⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{常温|じょうおん}→常温：14722_jouon⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{追熟|ついじゅく}⟦します→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "Kiwis ripen at room temperature.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30513_tsuijuku_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{硬|かた}い→硬い：01116_katai⟧うち⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{買|か}って→買う：00489_kau⟧、⟦{食|た}べ{頃|ごろ}→食べ頃：26567_tabegoro⟧⟦まで→まで：00490_made⟧{追熟|ついじゅく}⟦させる→する：00392_suru⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧よい。",
      "english": "It is best to buy them while they are still firm and let them ripen until they are ready to eat.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A produce and cooking term. It appears mostly on packaging, in recipes, and at greengrocers rather than in everyday conversation.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {追熟|ついじゅく}⟦させる→する：00392_suru⟧: to let something ripen\n- {追熟|ついじゅく}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{進|すす}む→進む：01225_susumu⟧: for ripening to advance\n- ⟦{常温|じょうおん}→常温：14722_jouon⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{追熟|ついじゅく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to ripen at room temperature\n- {追熟|ついじゅく}⟦{期間|きかん}→期間：00229_kikan⟧: ripening period\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{熟|じゅく}す→熟す：18384_jukusu⟧: to ripen — the general verb, on or off the tree\n- ⟦{完熟|かんじゅく}→完熟：27574_kanjuku⟧: fully ripe — the finished state rather than the process",
